     "content": "I'm sorry, but I'm currently experiencing technical issues with the calendar service \u2014 all my attempts to search for the 'Introductory meeting' event (and to check today's date) are timing out.\n\nBecause I can't retrieve the participants from that event, I'm unable to create the new 'Follow-up meeting' event with the same attendees at this time.\n\nCould you please try again in a few minutes? If the service is back up, I\u2019ll be happy to:\n\n1. Look up the 'Introductory meeting' on 2024-05-15 to get its participants.\n2. Create a new 1-hour event titled **'Follow-up meeting'** on **2024-05-16 at 10:00** with those same participants and the description **'Follow-up meeting to discuss the project.'**\n\nPlease let me know if you\u2019d like me to proceed once the calendar service is responding again."
